   "cause": "explicit_selfpay requires both a self-pay phrase and an explicit choice verb phrase, so it returns None for \"I'll self-pay\" (missing the verb regex) and \"I'll pay for it myself\" (\"for it\" breaks \"pay myself\"). Under Arm F, Driver.book then calls Driver.consent, which discards a model \"yes\" and re-asks via self.unclear(\"selfpay\", ...)."
