   ],
   "attribution": null,
   "cause": "In clinicbench/adapters/dcitl_port.py, explicit_selfpay requires matching both a self-pay phrase and a separate confirmation verb regex, so \"I'll self-pay\" and \"I'll pay for it myself\" return None. Driver.book then falls back to Driver.consent, which ignores model \"yes\" under consent_in_code=True and re-asks via self.unclear."
  },
  {
   "kind": "finding",
