    "clinicbench.adapters.dcitl_port.Driver.consent"
   ],
   "attribution": null,
   "cause": "explicit_selfpay requires both a phrase like 'pay myself' or 'self-pay' and an explicit verb phrase like 'i'll pay' or 'yes', so it returns None for 'I'll self-pay' and 'I'll pay for it myself'. Driver.book then falls back to Driver.consent, which under Arm F's consent_in_code=True ignores a model 'yes' and re-asks the patient."
